    "citation_verbatim": "We observed a marked decrease in the risk of major coronary heart disease among women who took estrogen with progestin (multivariate adjusted relative risk, 0.39; 95 percent confidence interval, 0.19 to 0.78)"
  },
  "requete_adverse": "requête adverse fictive (cas de gold set)",
  "citation_verbatim": "Absolute excess risks per 10 000 person-years attributable to estrogen plus progestin were 7 more CHD events, 8 more strokes, 8 more PEs, and 8 more invasive breast cancers",
